{"sections":[{"slug":"高阶关系范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"高阶关系范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶关系范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"高阶关系范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">高阶关系范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/关系2-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">关系</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是有拉回的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其关系</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)}(X,Y) = \\{X \\leftarrow Z \\to Y\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">归纳地定义</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">关系</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span></strong> ($n$-category of correspondences) $n\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)$ ($n\\geq 2$): <span lang=\"zh\">其对象仍为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{n\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)}(X,Y) = (n-1)\\mathsf{Corr}(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)}(X,Y)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">约定</span> $1\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)= \\mathcal C$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}